WEBVTT

00:05:59.542 --> 00:06:00.934
And then a couple years ago,

00:06:00.958 --> 00:06:03.000
I felt a little bit lost, creatively.

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:05.893
The engine was going down a little bit,

00:06:05.917 --> 00:06:07.292
and I got a sign ...

00:06:08.417 --> 00:06:10.292
I heard from voices from the sky ...

00:06:11.417 --> 00:06:13.268
or more it was like, birds.

00:06:13.292 --> 00:06:14.601
OK, fine, it was Twitter.

00:06:14.625 --> 00:06:15.893
And Twitter --

00:06:15.917 --> 00:06:17.184
(Laughter)

00:06:17.208 --> 00:06:18.685
It was Constance Wu on Twitter,

00:06:18.709 --> 00:06:20.643
it was Daniel Dae Kim,

00:06:20.667 --> 00:06:22.976
it was Jenny Yang, who's here today,

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:24.268
it was Alan Yang --

00:06:24.292 --> 00:06:27.601
all of these people
who were writing their frustrations

00:06:27.625 --> 00:06:30.351
with representation in Hollywood.